n>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\" fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" symmetric=\"true\"></mo></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nThe first equation is a false statement. Hence,the system has no solution. </p>\n</div></div>",
