    "q-73954": {
      "dom_id": "step-q73954",
      "name": "Question 15",
      "problem": "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}],\\,{a}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}16 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -18\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$",
      "worked_solution": "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}16 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -18\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{1} \\\\ 3{x}_{1} \\\\ 4{x}_{1}\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}5{x}_{2} \\\\ 4{x}_{2} \\\\ -3{x}_{2}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}16 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -18\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2} \\\\ 3{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2} \\\\ 4{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}16 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -18\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2}=16 \\\\ 3{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}=-1 \\\\ 4{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2}=-18\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the first equation by $3$, the second equation by $2$, and adding the resulting equations, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}15{x}_{2}+8{x}_{2} & =48-2 \\\\ 23{x}_{2} & =46 \\\\ {x}_{2} & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we substitute ${x}_{2}=2$  into the second equation to get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2} & =-1\\text{ } \\\\ 3{x}_{1}+4(2) & =-1 \\\\ 3{x}_{1} & =-9 \\\\ {x}_{1} & =-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=-3$ and ${x}_{2}=2$ into our third equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2} & =-18 \\\\ 4(-3)-3(2) & =-18 \\\\ -18 & =-18,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a true statement. \n\nSo, the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=-3$ and ${x}_{2}=2,$ which means\n\n$$\n-3{a}_{1}+2{a}_{2}=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=(-3)+2=-1.\n$$",
