    "q-105171": {
      "dom_id": "step-q105171",
      "name": "Question 17",
      "problem": "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}],\\,{a}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ -8 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}],\\,{a}_{3}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}?$",
      "worked_solution": "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ -8 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{3}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ 2{x}_{1} \\\\ -{x}_{1}\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}-5{x}_{2} \\\\ -8{x}_{2} \\\\ 5{x}_{2}\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{3} \\\\ 2{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-5{x}_{2}-{x}_{3} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}-8{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} \\\\ -{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-5{x}_{2}-{x}_{3}=1 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}-8{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3}=9 \\\\ -{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -5 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -8 & 2 & 9 \\\\ -1 & 5 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & -5 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -8 & 2 & 9 \\\\ -1 & 5 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -5 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 4 & 7 \\\\ -1 & 5 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -5 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 4 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-5{x}_{2}-{x}_{3}=1 \\\\ 2{x}_{2}+4{x}_{3}=7 \\\\ 0=2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHowever, the final equation $0=2$  gives a false statement. So the system has no solution.",
